# Firebase web configuration is stored in firebase.config.json (committed).
# No VITE_-prefixed env vars are needed for the Firebase config because the
# JSON file is imported directly and is safe to commit (public web config).
#
# If you need to override the Firebase project at build time, you may add:
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=my-project
# and read it via import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID in firebase.ts.
